    slug: `web-design-vs-web-development-differences`,
    title: `Web Design vs Web Development: Key Differences Explained`,
    excerpt: `Building a powerful online presence for your business in Sri Lanka starts with a great website. But as you begin your journey, you might hear terms like "web design" and "web development" used interchangeably. This…`,
    metaDescription: `Confused about web design vs web development? Understand the core differences, roles, and how they impact your website project. Learn how Uniix Studio helps.`,
    primaryKeyword: `web design vs web development`,
