    title: `What Is SEO for Business? Your Sri Lankan Guide to Growth`,
    excerpt: `Imagine your business is a hidden gem in Sri Lanka, offering incredible products or services. You know you're good, your customers love you, but new people just aren't finding you online. You've heard whispers of "SEO"…`,
